<title>JAPAN: Ginza Yamagataya - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ginza Yamagataya - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.67		vs	    7.27</p>
<p> Operating   loss 184 million	 vs   loss 134 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 135 million	 vs    loss 87 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 172 million	 vs   loss 130 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 13.47 yen	  vs    loss 10.23 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ginza Yamagataya Co Ltd is a leading maker of order-made men's suits.</p>
